Subject: [PATCH 07/11] ggml : add fused mHC route/merge ops

Single-node mHC router (gates + 20-pass Sinkhorn + pre-weighted branch) and stream merge for SenseNova Loop, with CPU reference. Bump RPC proto patch version for the two new ops.

